{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42803","headline":"送二郎君归长安 · 刘兼","name":"送二郎君归长安","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我儿辞去泪双流，蜀郡秦川两处愁。\n红叶满山归故国，黄茅徧地住他州。\n荷衣晓挂慙官吏，菱镜秋窥讶鬓髹。\n好向云泉营旧隐，莫教庄叟畏牺牛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘兼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42803.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42803","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}